Character asset for a 2D animation rig. Recreate this exact fox character, Charlie, as a clean 3D clay-style render, perfectly front-facing and symmetrical, head only, no neck, no body.
The face is intentionally FEATURELESS so that eyes and a mouth can be animated on top later:
- NO eyes, NO eyelids, NO eye sockets, NO eyebrows: just smooth orange fur in the upper face.
- NO mouth, NO lips, NO smile, NO philtrum line, NO "w" shape: the light cream muzzle below the nose is one smooth, rounded, uninterrupted surface.
Keep only: the big rounded ears with darker inner ear and small fluffy fur tufts inside, the cream three-lobed curl tuft on top, the round head with fluffy cheek tufts sticking out at both sides, the light cream muzzle, the glossy dark nose in the middle of the face, and two small light freckle dots on each cheek.
Soft studio lighting from the top left. Centered, the head fills about 80% of the canvas. Fully transparent background: no glow, no halo, no shadow, no vignette, no text.
